OL,3,AOpenAI makes ChatGPT less 'human' for
OL,4,Ateens in new safety update
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe maker of ChatGPT is rolling out a
OL,7,Frange of new safety features today for
OL,8,Funder-18s who use the AI chatbot.
OL,10,FThose with new teen accounts will be
OL,11,Fable to switch off the human voice
OL,12,Fresponse, in order to minimise the
OL,13,Ftech's ability to appear like a person.
OL,15,FOpenAI is also introducing regular
OL,16,Freminders for young people to take a
OL,17,Fbreak from using the tool, reminding
OL,18,Fthem ChatGPT is AI, and saying "it can
OL,19,Fwait".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,116,105,200,160,0,100
