OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI makes ChatGPT less 'human' for
OL,4,Ateens in new safety update
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm insisted this was not in
OL,7,Fresponse to a particular issue with
OL,8,Fchildren believing ChatGPT to be alive
OL,9,F- but there are growing concerns about
OL,10,Fpeople becoming convinced that the AI
OL,11,Ftools they interact with are sentient.
